    "title": "Newton County Sheriff searches for stolen mower - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Lout ,\n1 days ago Newton County Sheriff Colton Havard and his deputies are investigating the reported theft of what they say is a \"high dollar\" lawn mower. Havard said the investigation began on Sunday afternoon when it was reported that a home had been burglarized while the owner was attending church. Deputies determined that a safe containing miscellaneous contents and a John Deere 72\" zero-turn lawn mower had been stolen. The homeowner is offering a cash reward for credible information leading to the arrest of the person(s) responsible.\" or mower had been stolen. Read full article",
